THE TEXTURES
============

The image data shipped in `textures/` and embedded as base64 strings
in `js/textures.js` is extracted from Minecraft. These textures are
the property of Mojang Studios / Microsoft Corporation. They are NOT
the property of the copyright holder of the Code and are NOT covered
by the "ALL RIGHTS RESERVED" notice above.

This is a NON-COMMERCIAL, EDUCATIONAL, AND COMMUNITY FAN PROJECT.
The textures are included here under a fair-dealing / fan-project
rationale to let the tool render figures that visually match the
Minecraft block aesthetic.

NOT AFFILIATED
--------------
This project is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by,
licensed by, or in any way officially connected to Mojang Studios,
Mojang Synergies AB, Microsoft Corporation, or any of their
subsidiaries or affiliates. "Minecraft", the Minecraft logo, the
Creeper character, and the Minecraft block-texture designs are
trademarks and/or copyrighted works of their respective owners.

NO TEXTURE LICENSE
------------------
The copyright holder of the Code asserts NO rights over the textures
and grants NO license to use, copy, redistribute, modify, or rehost
them. If you fork or reuse this project, you must source your own
textures — for example by extracting them from a legitimate Minecraft
installation you own, or by producing original artwork that does not
replicate the Mojang assets.

REMOVAL ON REQUEST
------------------
If Mojang Studios, Microsoft Corporation, or any authorized
representative of either company asks for the textures (or any
specific texture) to be removed from this repository, they will be
removed without dispute or delay. To make such a request, please open
an issue on the project repository or contact the maintainer.


